---
// The home page's ways into making charts with AI: the skill, a chat prompt, and the published MCP server.
import AiCopy from './AiCopy.astro';
---

<section class="ai-section not-content" aria-labelledby="ai-section-title">
	<h2 id="ai-section-title">Ask your AI agent for a chart</h2>
	<p class="ai-lead">
		rhp uses CSS and JavaScript to build charts.
		The rhp skill and MCP server give your agent the guide, 30 recipes and a browser checker.
		The checker returns screenshots and fixes the agent can use before handing over the chart.
		Give no style and you get an original poster designed for its subject, with an interaction that fits.
	</p>
	<p class="ai-kicker">Build with AI</p>
	<div class="ai-ways">
		<div class="ai-way">
			<h3>In a coding agent</h3>
			<p class="ai-where">Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini CLI and more</p>
			<AiCopy what="install" />
			<p class="ai-then">Then ask for a chart:</p>
			<blockquote class="ai-ask">Make a chart of the world’s ten largest cities.</blockquote>
		</div>
		<div class="ai-way">
			<h3>In a chat app</h3>
			<p class="ai-where">ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini</p>
			<AiCopy what="prompt" />
			<p class="ai-then">Paste the prompt, then describe your chart after it.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="ai-way ai-way-mcp">
			<h3>With MCP tools</h3>
			<p class="ai-where">Apps that support local MCP servers</p>
			<p class="ai-then">
				Give your agent the guide, references, 30 recipes and browser checker as tools, with screenshots it can inspect.
				Use the MCP server on its own or alongside the skill.
			</p>
			<p class="ai-mcp-links">
				<a href="/ai/#with-mcp-tools">Set up the MCP server<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
				<a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@bezda/rhp-mcp">View the package on npm<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="ai-more">
		<a href="/ai/">What your agent does, the 30 recipes, and more ways to set it up<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
	</p>
</section>

<style>
	.ai-section.not-content {
		margin-block: 6rem;
	}

	/* The showcase's kicker, in its colors */
	.ai-kicker {
		margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
		font: 600 0.75rem/1 var(--sl-font-system-mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
	}

	:root[data-theme='light'] .ai-kicker {
		color: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-4xl);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: var(--sl-line-height-headings);
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.ai-lead {
		margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
		max-width: 46rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}

	/* The skill and chat cards sit side by side; the MCP option spans both columns. All stack on a phone. */
	.ai-ways {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.ai-way {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.9rem;
		min-width: 0;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		border-radius: var(--page-border-radius-4);
		background-color: var(--rhp-color-gray);
		box-shadow: var(--sl-shadow-md);
		--ai-copy-size: var(--sl-text-code-sm);
	}

	.ai-way-mcp {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
	}

	.ai-mcp-links {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
	}

	.ai-mcp-links a {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
		text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
	}

	.ai-mcp-links a:hover {
		color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
	}

	h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xl);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: var(--sl-line-height-headings);
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}

	.ai-where {
		margin: -0.4rem 0 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}

	.ai-then {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--sl-color-text);
	}

	/* What the reader types next, as they would type it */
	.ai-ask {
		margin: -0.3rem 0 0;
		padding: 0.1rem 0 0.1rem 0.9rem;
		border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--sl-color-accent-high);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}

	.ai-more {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
	}

	.ai-more a {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
		text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
		text-underline-offset: 0.3em;
	}

	.ai-more a:hover {
		color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
	}

	@media (max-width: 50rem) {
		h2 {
			font-size: var(--sl-text-3xl);
		}

		.ai-ways {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}

		.ai-way {
			padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
